      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.67,
      "end_seconds": 31.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.33,
      "end_seconds": 61.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.69,
      "text": "okay: height 178 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And heart rate 120, BMI works out to 26.5, weight 84 kilos, respiratory rate 16, pressure 117 over 71. When did this begin? Take your time, there's no rush"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.9,
      "end_seconds": 77.47,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "okay, so just since yesterday i'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing i wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.6,
      "end_seconds": 82.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Alright, how troublesome is it day to day?"
