      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.5,
      "end_seconds": 207.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "and besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.92,
      "end_seconds": 213.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.27,
      "end_seconds": 216.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "and besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.52,
      "end_seconds": 228.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "yes, diabetes and arthritis in your knees are known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.58,
      "end_seconds": 239.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.13,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I hardly move around during the day. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.45,
      "end_seconds": 246.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "so, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.06,
      "end_seconds": 257.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "hmm, I take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed uh, though honestly, some days I forget to take it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.19,
      "end_seconds": 274.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "okay have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.69,
      "end_seconds": 283.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.79,
      "end_seconds": 288.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Okay, could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.59,
      "end_seconds": 292.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.89,
      "end_seconds": 310.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "you are dry breathing deeply and your breath smells fruity"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.16,
      "end_seconds": 335.05,
      "duration_seconds": 18.89,
      "text": "thank you, you can get dressed from what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with diabetic ketoacidosis i'm gonna order a blood sugar and ketone test, for thirst and vomiting i'm going to order blood gas and electrolytes, for DKA"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.19,
      "end_seconds": 345.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, okay, I'll do it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.7,
      "end_seconds": 368.08,
      "duration_seconds": 21.38,
      "text": "you need to go to hospital now for insulin and fluids keep an eye out and if you cannot get there now call us the same day or go to emergency see me again straight away let me check I've been clear what will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.72,
      "end_seconds": 375.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "so, I come back straight away is that that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.77,
      "end_seconds": 383.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to to go over again?"
    },
